      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So you're asking for PC avatars on quest.\n\nI just want to point out that the reverse would be extremely difficult for VRChat to implement, like an option to load data compiled for android on PC. Mixing up the platforms and ignoring shaders, still very hard.\n\nIf it wasn't very hard, VRChat would have option to show quest avatars on PC, and I'd use that option and never complain about performance.\n\nTrying to dynamic run PC shaders on quest, it's like hilariously difficult of a problem. \n\nLike if you wanted to render PC avatar in software at like a frame every few minutes sure, go for it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
