  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-10-03T04:54:58.413Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think it would be great if there was a way to enable loading PC only or very poor avatars on mobile devices after accepting a warning that it may cause crashes or performance issues, since some of us have phones stronger than their PC anyways",
